16
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:45,080
Okay.

17
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:46,800
I can have it ready by the end of the week.

18
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:48,600
No, you don't understand.

19
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:50,780
I need this tomorrow morning.

20
