00:05:38,810 --> 00:05:39,350
What is this phrase?

143
00:05:39,610 --> 00:05:40,150
Thank God.

144
00:05:40,470 --> 00:05:40,810
Okay.

145
00:05:41,050 --> 00:05:45,630
This is a phrase we use in English to say that we're happy about something or that we're relieved.

146
00:05:46,370 --> 00:05:46,550
Okay.

147
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:51,590
So maybe I'm nervous that the mail isn't going to come today.

148
00:05:52,110 --> 00:05:55,370
Then the mail comes and I say, oh, thank God the mail came.

149
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,680
Yeah.

150
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,680
I'm happy.

151
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,070
I was hoping it would come.

152
00:05:58,680 --> 00:05:58,870
