167
00:06:29,590 --> 00:06:30,510
I need those papers ASAP.

168
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:32,360
I need those reports ASAP.

169
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,360
Exactly.

170
00:06:33,370 --> 00:06:38,130
So you can say it either way, ASAP or ASAP and it means immediately.

171
00:06:38,690 --> 00:06:39,030
Okay.

172
